{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24380","headline":"宅西有流水墙下构小楼临玩之时颇有幽趣因命歌酒聊以自娱独醉独吟偶题五绝句 三 · 白居易","name":"宅西有流水墙下构小楼临玩之时颇有幽趣因命歌酒聊以自娱独醉独吟偶题五绝句 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日灩水光摇素壁，风飘树影拂朱栏。\n皆言此处宜弦管，试奏霓裳一曲看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}